{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790437074381,"sessionID":"ses_f21a46dabffeQeQWctSfVpfbN2","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_73e77c76d15a4538a9f669a4","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Explore codebase structure","prompt":"Explore the /workspace directory structure thoroughly. I need to understand:\n1. The overall directory structure\n2. The contents of res://data/units/unit_stats.gd (if it exists)\n3. The contents of res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd and battle_unit.tscn (if they exist)\n4. The contents of res://custom_nodes/ (if it exists)\n5. Any existing Team enum, BattleUnit class, UnitStats class, or DetectRange/TargetFinder classes\n6. Look for any existing group names like \"red_bots\" or \"blue_bots\"\n7. The project.godot or project file to understand the project setup\n\nReturn ALL file contents you find for the relevant files, especially unit_stats.gd, battle_unit.gd, battle_unit.tscn, and any script that defines Team, BattleUnit, or UnitStats.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_f21a3efd9ffeB4BEmlTPOe654C\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nHere is a comprehensive summary of everything found in `/workspace`.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Overall Directory Structure\n\n```\n/workspace/\n├── .godot/                          # Godot editor cache/metadata\n│   ├── .gdignore\n│   ├── editor/\n│   │   ├── filesystem_cache10\n│   │   ├── main.tscn-folding-3ad5c15c4f3250da0cc7c1af1770d85f.cfg\n│   │   └── project_metadata.cfg\n│   ├── global_script_class_cache.cfg\n│   ├── scene_groups_cache.cfg\n│   └── uid_cache.bin\n├── data/\n│   ├── enemies/\n│   │   └── zombie.tres              # UnitStats resource (team=ENEMY, attack_range=1)\n│   └── units/\n│       ├── unit_stats.gd            # UnitStats class & Team enum\n│       ├── unit_stats.gd.uid\n│       └── bjorn.tres               # UnitStats resource (team=PLAYER, attack_range=3)\n├── project.godot                    # Godot 4.4 project config\n├── scenes/\n│   ├── battle_unit/\n│   │   ├── battle_unit.gd           # BattleUnit class (Area2D)\n│   │   ├── battle_unit.gd.uid\n│   │   └── battle_unit.tscn         # BattleUnit scene (Area2D + CollisionShape2D)\n│   └── main.tscn                    # Main scene with 3 BattleUnit instances\n├── scripts/                         # Empty directory\n└── task_config.json                 # Task instructions for arena bot targeting setup\n```\n\n**`custom_nodes/` does NOT exist yet.** It is mentioned in `task_config.json` as a directory to create.\n\n---\n\n## 2. `res://data/units/unit_stats.gd` (full contents)\n\n**Path:** `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd`\n\n```gdscript\nclass_name UnitStats\nextends Resource\n\nenum Team {PLAYER, ENEMY}\n\nconst MAX_ATTACK_RANGE := 5\n\n@export var team: Team\n@export_range(1, MAX_ATTACK_RANGE) var attack_range: int = 1\n```\n\nKey observations:\n- Defines `class_name UnitStats` extending `Resource`.\n- Has a `Team` enum with two values: `PLAYER` (0) and `ENEMY` (1).\n- Exports `team` (type `Team`) and `attack_range` (1-5, default 1).\n- Does **NOT** yet have the `TARGET` constant dictionary that the task requires.\n\n---\n\n## 3. `res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd` (full contents)\n\n**Path:** `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd`\n\n```gdscript\nclass_name BattleUnit\nextends Area2D\n\n@export var stats: UnitStats: set = _set_stats\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tif stats:\n\t\t_set_stats(stats)\n\n\nfunc _set_stats(value: UnitStats) -> void:\n\tstats = value\n\t\n\tif not stats or not is_node_ready():\n\t\treturn\n\t\n\tstats = value.duplicate()\n\tcollision_layer = stats.team + 1\n```\n\nKey observations:\n- Defines `class_name BattleUnit` extending `Area2D`.\n- Has an exported `stats: UnitStats` with a setter `_set_stats`.\n- On `_ready()`, calls `_set_stats` if stats exist.\n- `_set_stats` duplicates the stats and sets `collision_layer = stats.team + 1`.\n- Does **NOT** yet have the `detect_range` and `target_finder` `@onready` variables.\n\n---\n\n## 4. `res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn` (full contents)\n\n**Path:** `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn`\n\n```gdtext\n[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd\" id=\"1_battle_unit\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://data/units/bjorn.tres\" id=\"2_stats\"]\n\n[sub_resource type=\"RectangleShape2D\" id=\"1_body_shape\"]\nsize = Vector2(24, 24)\n\n[node name=\"BattleUnit\" type=\"Area2D\"]\ncollision_mask = 0\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")\nstats = ExtResource(\"2_stats\")\n\n[node name=\"CollisionShape2D\" type=\"CollisionShape2D\" parent=\".\"]\nshape = SubResource(\"1_body_shape\")\n```\n\nKey observations:\n- The root node is `BattleUnit` (type `Area2D`).\n- It has a single child: `CollisionShape2D` with a `RectangleShape2D` (24x24).\n- `collision_mask = 0` (doesn't detect collisions with anything by default).\n- Does **NOT** yet have `DetectRange` or `TargetFinder` child nodes.\n\n---\n\n## 5. `res://custom_nodes/` -- **DOES NOT EXIST**\n\nThe glob search for `/workspace/custom_nodes/**/*` returned **no files**. This directory needs to be created and populated with `detect_range.gd` and `target_finder.gd`.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Existing Classes, Enums, and Groups\n\n### Team Enum\n- **Defined in:** `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd` (line 4)\n- `enum Team {PLAYER, ENEMY}` where `PLAYER = 0`, `ENEMY = 1`\n\n### BattleUnit Class\n- **Defined in:** `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd` (line 1)\n- `class_name BattleUnit extends Area2D`\n- Registered in `/workspace/.godot/global_script_class_cache.cfg`\n\n### UnitStats Class\n- **Defined in:** `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd` (line 1)\n- `class_name UnitStats extends Resource`\n- Registered in `/workspace/.godot/global_script_class_cache.cfg`\n- Used by two `.tres` resources:\n  - **`bjorn.tres`**: `team = 0` (PLAYER), `attack_range = 3`\n  - **`zombie.tres`**: `team = 1` (ENEMY), `attack_range = 1`\n\n### DetectRange / TargetFinder Classes\n- **Do NOT exist yet.** No files found for either class name.\n\n### Group Names\n- **`\"red_bots\"`** and **`\"blue_bots\"`** exist as scene groups in `main.tscn`:\n  - `BlueBot` is in group `blue_bots` (uses `bjorn.tres` stats, PLAYER team)\n  - `RedBotNear` is in group `red_bots` (uses `zombie.tres` stats, ENEMY team)\n  - `RedBotFar` is in group `red_bots` (uses `zombie.tres` stats, ENEMY team)\n- These groups are cached in `/workspace/.godot/scene_groups_cache.cfg`.\n\n---\n\n## 7. `project.godot` (full contents)\n\n**Path:** `/workspace/project.godot`\n\n```ini\n; Engine configuration file.\n; It's best edited using the editor UI and not directly,\n; since the parameters that go here are not all obvious.\n;\n; Format:\n;   [section] ; section goes between []\n;   param=value ; assign values to parameters\n\nconfig_version=5\n\n[application]\n\nconfig/name=\"Detect Range Target Finder\"\nconfig/description=\"Minimal autobattler targeting task derived from the GodotGameLab combat-preparation tutorial\"\nrun/main_scene=\"res://scenes/main.tscn\"\nconfig/features=PackedStringArray(\"4.4\")\n\n[rendering]\n\nrenderer/rendering_method=\"gl_compatibility\"\n```\n\nKey observations:\n- Godot version: **4.4**\n- Project name: **\"Detect Range Target Finder\"**\n- Main scene: `res://scenes/main.tscn`\n- Renderer: `gl_compatibility`\n\n---\n\n## Supplementary: `main.tscn` (full contents)\n\n**Path:** `/workspace/scenes/main.tscn`\n\n```gdtext\n[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"PackedScene\" path=\"res://scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.tscn\" id=\"1_battle_unit\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://data/units/bjorn.tres\" id=\"2_player_stats\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Resource\" path=\"res://data/enemies/zombie.tres\" id=\"3_enemy_stats\"]\n\n[node name=\"Main\" type=\"Node2D\"]\n\n[node name=\"BlueBot\" parent=\".\" groups=[\"blue_bots\"] instance=ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")]\nposition = Vector2(0, 0)\nstats = ExtResource(\"2_player_stats\")\n\n[node name=\"RedBotNear\" parent=\".\" groups=[\"red_bots\"] instance=ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")]\nposition = Vector2(60, 0)\nstats = ExtResource(\"3_enemy_stats\")\n\n[node name=\"RedBotFar\" parent=\".\" groups=[\"red_bots\"] instance=ExtResource(\"1_battle_unit\")]\nposition = Vector2(150, 0)\nstats = ExtResource(\"3_enemy_stats\")\n```\n\nThree `BattleUnit` instances are placed: one `BlueBot` (PLAYER/blue_bots) at (0,0), and two `RedBot` enemies (ENEMY/red_bots) at (60,0) and (150,0). The scenes use overridden `stats` resources rather than the default `bjorn.tres` from the scene.\n\n---\n\n## Summary of what EXISTS vs what is NEEDED\n\n| Item | Status | Location |\n|---|---|---|\n| `Team` enum | EXISTS | `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd` line 4 |\n| `UnitStats` class | EXISTS | `/workspace/data/units/unit_stats.gd` line 1 |\n| `BattleUnit` class | EXISTS | `/workspace/scenes/battle_unit/battle_unit.gd` line 1 |\n| `TARGET` constant on UnitStats | MISSING | Needs adding to `unit_stats.gd` |\n| `DetectRange` class | MISSING | Needs `custom_nodes/detect_range.gd` created |\n| `TargetFinder` class | MISSING | Needs `custom_nodes/target_finder.gd` created |\n| `custom_nodes/` directory | MISSING | Needs to be created |\n| `detect_range` / `target_finder` vars in battle_unit.gd | MISSING | Needs adding to `battle_unit.gd` |\n| DetectRange/TargetFinder nodes in battle_unit.tscn | MISSING | Needs adding to `battle_unit.tscn` |\n| `red_bots` / `blue_bots` groups | EXIST | In `main.tscn` and scene_groups_cache |\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f21a46dabffeQeQWctSfVpfbN2","sessionId":"ses_f21a3efd9ffeB4BEmlTPOe654C","model":{"modelID":"deepseek-v4-pro","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Explore codebase structure","time":{"start":1790436970537,"end":1790437074369}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_5057327b-e626-4eef-8d5a-4ad766ec087